  51:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c **** 
  52:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c ****     (#) Configure the EXTI line using HAL_EXTI_SetConfigLine().
  53:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c ****         (++) Choose the interrupt line number by setting "Line" member from
  54:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c ****              EXTI_ConfigTypeDef structure.
  55:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c ****         (++) Configure the interrupt and/or event mode using "Mode" member from
  56:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c ****              EXTI_ConfigTypeDef structure.
  57:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c ****         (++) For configurable lines, configure rising and/or falling trigger
  58:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c ****              "Trigger" member from EXTI_ConfigTypeDef structure.
  59:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c ****         (++) For Exti lines linked to gpio, choose gpio port using "GPIOSel"
  60:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c ****              member from GPIO_InitTypeDef structure.
  61:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c **** 
  62:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c ****     (#) Get current Exti configuration of a dedicated line using
  63:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c ****         HAL_EXTI_GetConfigLine().
  64:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c ****         (++) Provide exiting handle as parameter.
  65:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c ****         (++) Provide pointer on EXTI_ConfigTypeDef structure as second parameter.
  66:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c **** 
  67:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c ****     (#) Clear Exti configuration of a dedicated line using HAL_EXTI_ClearConfigLine().
  68:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c ****         (++) Provide exiting handle as parameter.
  69:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c **** 
  70:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c ****     (#) Register callback to treat Exti interrupts using HAL_EXTI_RegisterCallback().
  71:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c ****         (++) Provide exiting handle as first parameter.
  72:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c ****         (++) Provide which callback will be registered using one value from
