  74:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c ****         (++) Provide callback function pointer.
  75:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c **** 
  76:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c ****     (#) Get interrupt pending bit using HAL_EXTI_GetPending().
  77:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c **** 
  78:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_exti.c ****     (#) Clear interrupt pending bit using HAL_EXTI_ClearPending().
